{"id":8859759575239,"title":"Personalized Christian Affirmation Butterflies Th - Christian Blankets","handle":"personalized-christian-affirmation-butterflies-th-christian-blankets","description":"\u003cp\u003eAt Jeminise, we believe in creating gifts that speak from the heart. This personalized blanket combines faith, love, and comfort, making it an ideal keepsake or thoughtful gift for Christian women. Featuring inspirational Christian designs and the option for custom text, this throw blanket offers daily encouragement and spiritual inspiration.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eUnique \u0026amp; Personalized Gift:\u003c\/strong\u003e A perfect custom gift that combines faith, love, and comfort, designed to be a cherished keepsake for Christian women.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Customization:\u003c\/strong\u003e Personalize your blanket by selecting a design and adding a custom name or text to create a unique and meaningful item.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFour Size Options:\u003c\/strong\u003e Available in Small (40x30 inches), Medium (50x40 inches), Large (60x50 inches), and X-Large (80x60 inches) to suit various preferences and uses.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eInspirational Christian Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Features uplifting faith-based messages and Christian themes, providing daily encouragement and spiritual inspiration.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVersatile for Any Occasion:\u003c\/strong\u003e An ideal gift for birthdays, Christmas, Valentine's Day, New Year, or other special milestones, offering spiritual encouragement.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSoft \u0026amp; Lightweight:\u003c\/strong\u003e Made with polyester fabric and fill, this lightweight throw blanket is comfortable for all seasons.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Care:\u003c